      "explanation": "First evaluate the number inside the parentheses by using a common denominator:\n\\[\n\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac36+\\frac26=\\frac56.\n\\]\nA reciprocal multiplies the original number to give \\(1\\). Since \\(\\frac56\\ne0\\), its reciprocal is \\(\\frac65\\), as\n\\[\n\\frac56\\cdot\\frac65=1.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{\\frac65}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
